ios: head icons stack above the head

A player's head icons stack up from the head in 274's order: the skull just above it, a protection prayer's icon
over that, a player's hint arrow over them all. Upstream (as 274 did) drew each next icon 25 px lower than the one
before, so a skulled player with a protection prayer had the prayer's icon on the face.

